  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tsp of sesame oil in a large pressure cooker over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the pork tenderloin and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the gochujang, gochugaru, soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, and ginger. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the zucchini and carrots. Close the lid and cook at high pressure for 10 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally for 5 minutes, then quick-release any remaining pressure.",
    "Stir in the green onions and serve hot."
  ],
